  "version": "0.1.2-beta.7",
  "notes": "### tTerm Beta 更新内容\r\n\r\n本次 beta 重点增强了 SFTP 文件操作、远程文件编辑体验，并提升了终端连接稳定性与应用安全性。\r\n\r\n- 新增远程文件编辑能力，支持通过 CodeMirror 编辑远程文件。\r\n- 增强代码编辑体验，加入语法高亮、编辑器样式优化与连接信息展示。\r\n- 为远程文件编辑增加文件大小限制与提示，避免误打开过大的远程文件。\r\n- 新增 SFTP 文件/文件夹图标展示，文件列表更易识别。\r\n- 支持 SFTP 文件夹下载，并优化下载进度显示，包括单项完成与批量完成状态。\r\n- 优化 TabBar，在标签过多时支持溢出菜单与搜索。\r\n- 改进 SSH 连接校验、host key 匹配和认证超时处理，连接失败时给出更明确的原因。\r\n- 改进 PTY 错误处理，并尊重系统 `LANG` 环境变量。\r\n- 加强应用安全策略，启用 CSP，并为 CodeMirror 增加 nonce 支持。\r\n- 优化主题编辑器加载方式，减少初始加载开销。\r\n- 新增错误边界，应用异常时可更优雅地恢复。\r\n\r\n### tTerm Beta Changelog\r\n\r\nThis beta focuses on improving SFTP workflows, remote file editing, terminal connection stability, and application security.\r\n\r\n- Added remote file editing with CodeMirror integration.\r\n- Improved the code editing experience with syntax highlighting, refined editor UI, and connection details.\r\n- Added file size limits and warnings for remote file editing to prevent opening overly large files by mistake.\r\n- Added file and folder icons for SFTP entries, making remote directories easier to scan.\r\n- Added SFTP directory download support with improved progress reporting for individual items and batch completion.\r\n- Improved the TabBar with overflow handling and search when many tabs are open.\r\n- Improved SSH connection validation, host key matching, and authentication timeout handling, with clearer error messages.\r\n- Improved PTY error handling and support for the system `LANG` environment variable.\r\n- Strengthened application security with Content Security Policy enforcement and nonce support for CodeMirror.\r\n- Lazy-loaded the theme editor to reduce initial loading overhead.\r\n- Added an ErrorBoundary for more graceful recovery from application errors.\n",
